It's not good that you have repeatedly missed them with your
wand.  But the wand of death is one of the fastest solutions.
Try to get into a position where one (or better both) Wizards
are standing between you and a wall.  The reflection of the
death ray gives you a double chance to succeed.  An advanced
solution is playing billiard across the wall with your death
ray to hit more than one Wizard inkarnation at a time.

Another quick solution is to wait for a cockatrice corpse so
that you can use as a weapon to hit the Wizards and also the
Priest.

You will also be able to kill the Wizards with your weapons.
Don't let the Priest come close, first handle the Wizards.

